":"Milk"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"« zhǐ néng jiáo yìdiǎnr shēng mǐ… yǒu de rén hē le hǎishuǐ ».","en":"“zhǐ néng jiáo yìdiǎnr shēng mǐ… yǒu de rén hē le hǎishuǐ”."}},{"q":{"fr":"Que perd Jianzhen pendant le retour vers le nord ?","en":"What does Jianzhen lose on the way back north?"},"options":[{"fr":"La vue","en":"His sight"},{"fr":"Sa voix","en":"His voice"},{"fr":"Sa jambe","en":"His leg"},{"fr":"Ses livres","en":"His books"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"« shuāng yǎn mànmàn de shénme dōu kàn bu jiàn le ».","en":"“shuāng yǎn mànmàn de shénme dōu kàn bu jiàn le”."}},{"q":{"fr":"Que répond-il à ceux qui pensent qu'il va abandonner ?","en":"What does he answer those who think he'll give up?"},"options":[{"fr":"Ses yeux ne voient plus, mais son cœur voit encore","en":"His eyes no longer see, but his heart still does"},{"fr":"Qu'il est trop vieux","en":"That he is too old"},{"fr":"Qu'il rentre chez lui","en":"That he is going home"},{"fr":"Qu'il enverra un disciple","en":"That he will send a disciple"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"« wǒ de xīn hái kàn de jiàn ».","en":"“wǒ de xīn hái kàn de jiàn”."}},{"q":{"fr":"Combien de temps s'écoule entre la première préparation et l'arrivée ?","en":"How long passes between the first preparation and arrival?"},"options":[{"fr":"Onze ans","en":"Eleven years"},{"fr":"Six mois","en":"Six months"},{"fr":"Trois ans","en":"Three years"},{"fr":"Vingt ans","en":"Twenty years"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"Il arrive à 66 ans, « yǐjīng guò le shíyī nián ».","en":"He arrives at 66, “yǐjīng guò le shíyī nián”."}},{"q":{"fr":"Comment corrige-t-il les erreurs sur les médicaments au Japon ?","en":"How does he correct mistakes about medicines in Japan?"},"options":[{"fr":"En les reconnaissant à l'odeur","en":"By recognising them by smell"},{"fr":"En les goûtant tous","en":"By tasting them all"},{"fr":"Avec un livre","en":"With a book"},{"fr":"Ses disciples regardent pour lui","en":"His disciples look for him"}],"answer":0,"why":{"fr":"« yòng bízi wén, jiù né